{"sha": "84350fd21286683dd1363ee8afc866367c1f7fcb1e062b4c1633e4c8234fe7c2", "body": ["\\chapter{较大数的乘法}\\label{ch:g4:mult}", "", "三年级学过一位数乘法（见\\cref{ch:g3:mult}），本章", "研究乘两位数的情形，并解释竖式乘法中", "那条神秘的“错位行”——它不过是把乘数", "拆分为十位与个位。", "", "\\section{乘整十数}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[乘 10、20、300\\,\\dots]\\label{prop:g4:mult:tens}", "乘 $10$ 时，末尾添一个零；乘 $100$ 时，末尾添两个零。计算", "乘 $20$，先乘 $2$，再乘 $10$：", "\\[", "36 \\times 20 = 36 \\times 2 \\times 10 = 72 \\times 10 = 720 .", "\\]", "同理 $14 \\times 300 = 14 \\times 3 \\times 100 = 4\\,200$。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\section{两位数的竖式乘法}", "", "\\begin{example}[为什么要错位？]\\label{ex:g4:mult:why}", "计算 $23 \\times 12$，把 $12$ 拆成 $10 + 2$：", "\\[", "23 \\times 12 = 23 \\times 2 + 23 \\times 10 = 46 + 230 = 276 .", "\\]", "竖式乘法恰好把这两个积", "上下排列，第二个积向左错一位，因为它是", "若干个\\emph{十}：", "\\[", "\\begin{array}{r}", "2\\,3 \\\\", "\\times\\ 1\\,2 \\\\", "\\hline", "4\\,6 \\\\", "2\\,3\\,\\cdot \\\\", "\\hline", "2\\,7\\,6", "\\end{array}", "\\]", "（圆点表示错位行的个位位置，", "常常留空）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.42]", "  \\fill[omDef!18] (0,0) rectangle (20,10);", "  \\fill[omThm!18] (0,10) rectangle (20,12);", "  \\fill[omDef!34] (20,0) rectangle (23,10);", "  \\fill[omThm!34] (20,10) rectangle (23,12);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (23,12);", "  \\draw[thick] (20,0) -- (20,12);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,10) -- (23,10);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (10,5) {$20 \\times 10 = 200$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (10,11) {$20 \\times 2 = 40$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, rotate=90] at (21.5,5) {$3 \\times 10 = 30$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (21.5,11) {$6$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (10,0) {$20$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (21.5,0) {$3$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,5) {$10$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,11) {$2$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 矩形图示 $23 \\times 12$：四个容易算的积，", "$200 + 40 + 30 + 6 = 276$。竖式乘法把它们合并为", "两行：$46$（“$\\times 2$”一行）和 $230$（“$\\times 10$”", "一行）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[两位数的竖式乘法]\\label{met:g4:mult:column}", "计算 $457 \\times 36$：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 第一行：$457 \\times 6 = 2\\,742$；", "  \\item 第二行：$457 \\times 3$ 个\\emph{十} $= 1\\,371$ 个十 ——", "        将 $1\\,371$ 向左错一位写出；", "  \\item 将两行相加：$2\\,742 + 13\\,710 = 16\\,452$；", "  \\item 估算检验：$457 \\times 36 \\approx 500 \\times 36", "        = 18\\,000$？更好的是：$450 \\times 36$ 约为 $16\\,000$ ——", "        结果合理。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\[", "\\begin{array}{r}", "4\\,5\\,7 \\\\", "\\times\\ \\ \\,3\\,6 \\\\", "\\hline", "2\\,7\\,4\\,2 \\\\", "1\\,3\\,7\\,1\\,\\cdot \\\\", "\\hline", "1\\,6\\,4\\,5\\,2", "\\end{array}", "\\]", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[口算技巧]\\label{ex:g4:mult:tricks}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{拆分凑整}：$18 \\times 11 = 18 \\times 10", "        + 18 = 198$。", "  \\item \\emph{接近整百的数}：$25 \\times 99 = 25 \\times 100 -", "        25 = 2\\,475$。", "  \\item \\emph{折半与加倍}：$16 \\times 35 = 8 \\times 70 =", "        560$（将一个因数减半、另一个因数加倍，", "        积保持不变）。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{应用问题中的乘法}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g4:mult:problem}", "某学校订购了 $28$ 箱纸，每箱 $145$ 张。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 列式：$145 \\times 28$。", "  \\item 估算：$150 \\times 30 = 4\\,500$，两个因数都取大了，", "        结果略微偏大。", "  \\item 竖式计算：$145 \\times 8 = 1\\,160$；$145 \\times 2$ 个十", "        $= 2\\,900$；合计 $4\\,060$。", "  \\item 作答：学校共收到 $4\\,060$ 张纸。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{example}", ""]}